Third-party notices
===================

Nightshift includes material adapted from the third-party projects below. Each entry names what was taken, where it lives here, and
the project's license text as it was published.

(Agent definitions adapted from affaan-m/ecc are noted separately in .claude/agents/ECC-NOTICE.md.)

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
HKUDS/ViMax
https://github.com/HKUDS/ViMax (commit 01b4696ebb54805dc465f5f815f5ee87891909d8)

What was taken: the storyboard rules and the shot decomposition of agents/storyboard_artist.py
(system_prompt_template_design_storyboard, system_prompt_template_decompose_visual_description, and the
